    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. could you expand a bit on the \"non-performance\" part? we've had issues before where suppliers basically disappear or stop fulfilling orders without warning, making it feel like there are hidden risks or actors working against us. how do we write the contract so we aren't blindsided by that kind of bad behavior?",
