    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i guess i'm also worried about the more \"unpredictable\" side of things. not just legal breaches, but those situations where things just go wrong in ways that feel almost malicious or chaotic, like someone is intentionally sabotaging the supply line or hiding things in the fine print. are there ways to address those types of \"bad faith\" scenarios in the language of the contract?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
