      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To address bad faith or intentionally opaque behavior, incorporate a broad covenant requiring the supplier to operate in good faith and with reasonable diligence. Include an audit right that allows you to verify their compliance, quality control, and supply chain integrity. Furthermore, explicitly state that willful misconduct or deceptive practices constitute a material breach, even if not explicitly detailed elsewhere. This language provides a stronger contractual foundation against unforeseen malicious actions.",
      "source": "target",
